117 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 44 0 R/E(Restricted access meetings are scheduled for a duration of 30 minutes \(or more, depending on the topic or nature of request\). They are an opportunity for a closed-door discussion with agencies or delegations with whom you may have an ongoing investigation, operation, prosecution or other query/case, in an informal setting that is meant to facilitate the sharing of information, intelligence, breaking through bottlenecks and identifying next steps, together.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

118 0 obj
