<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 250 0 R/E(Country C's prosecution service has sent an MLA request to country D but hasn\220t heard back from them. To prepare for the restricted access meeting, country D is encouraged to check if the MLA request has been received, and what the status is, and what is preventing progress.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

120 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 251 0 R/E(Countries E, F and G are source, transit and destination countries. Customs officers from each country are having an introductory meeting, to identify a trusted informal contact point in each country for easier cooperation in future cases.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[11]>>
